data: {"type":"response.completed","sequence_number":2170,"response":{"id":"resp_09e7677d2c9d8e14016adb2f3816048191af88577186a2e937","object":"response","created_at":1792749368,"completed_at":1792749395,"status":"completed","background":false,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"moderation":null,"model":"gpt-6-luna","access_programs":null,"previous_response_id":null,"instructions":"Complete the supplied mathematical task using only its explicit inputs and tools. Submit the requested JSON artifact through submit_artifact. Tool feedback is real task feedback; do not invent a successful check. This is a Yui workflow stage. Read the relevant declared Yui rules, preserve the supplied proof route and exact allowed assumptions, and distinguish mathematical review from structural checks.","output":[{"type":"reasoning","id":"rs_09e7677d2c9d8e14016adb2f3e1cdc8191a2c5e238ac31a2ab","summary":[],"content":[],"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABq2y8-cl0s36i3c0HzH095XoYU88pqlED1S0r8oVHT5mwHpLN-vyki0DInV72pmhz1VMZ5pw3sUwF4mibtlw_RpMSXmR56SB0RYWAdijeYHDYI4hQAUJ82P9K8tV9XCVgNkMvJaPfwjrs6odjv92KUF-Gw-lEjrlPb_pdQLg0BcheQVaVJXorcDMe92WR1IhbMBEM1F-Q4slJ3cphmuGoxVZ1QQrikJD1QVPXRB4eKyCxda0ps-cNlFx3DVfq_sObjQhBegjAlmdXVI0HpgF4OnHYfw2hfoe572Fz95PKlf6CF2Kc1T4OoAxQrmVt6wdR5Kccmqub0he5DWXyatoDYgWdqtEr1HxLaqtI7XHUguViX4jYwPbzTEJnT0PW5tmwUNrwWfbfsNjKZllq7CShbXnyyXZ8LMtdMZZdnGm7KWyJCU2MnQjvDyKz-DyXbFcerU6WVVsBxJrW3wYgG-BoODncJ0_M1QbCn_Kqz4RMih4Vt816zmuLOccOIggojYN_AVmAPdrdMcYG6T1NvF9NMrSnpetxUUp2x2UtWEYVEgADiqA_MkuyA7e0liD0HWWsoDoI-j2Jatr0Cneiw6D2LHFM-F7i-RIefG645rMcP0C5Ei1tyMWbTB8m0MARsQwVkASdEcCYUBJFzxUomBNOD3qZu28Ud4IUuhuE4faqTtOTk5nQSZucEg3tqGrthzIhOv0ko8u_JxtjVOS-WFhKBTaIQoyK6P3MsKiTMHxe2iR2IqVc4KNz17N9dtgfU1cv99JGqpV_XVxzLRKdgw5boa_kwmx_3_g84jdxi75dWaB_-9FPgic11vJYhTes9eC4F3ANoJWQLkFZYjrEYvari7a96KaEOf9XTk7hw5hgRBtEfFEuILxJ9Non4fLydlx7xtX3Zn-iNNsXum-A8Qkg0ecC3ckj1y46Cl-vVgj8__4PKXqXCvTnfYiO3F4m5xpfUSke024grQHqA1sm5CLWBd7fvhLWj4d3Paqy8gdRk_7zqq7hbuz2XsTeCsY43DwFPpiqoIZDsNSxY4Pbj7XRwL7z4uZv